 R←Test_Misc_100(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;buff;html;v
⍝ Checks whether the online documentation is up-to-date
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 buff←HttpCommand.Get'https://download.aplteam.com/MarkAPL.html'
 'Could not load required page; Internet connection?!'Assert 0=buff.rc
 html←buff.Data
 v←{⍵↑⍨¯1+⍵⍳' '}'<p>This document refers to version '{⍵↓⍨(¯1+≢⍺)+1⍳⍨⍺⍷⍵}html
 →T.PassesIf v≡⊃{⍺,'.',⍵}/2↑'.'APLTreeUtils2.Split ##.MarkAPL.Version   ⍝ Fails in case the online documentation is not up-to-date

 R←T._OK
